<h2 class="n-h2" id="ground-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:16ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Parking, walking and transit</h2>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:46ch">Niwot is unincorporated, so parking rules, road work and trail closures are set by Boulder County rather than a town. Posted signs override anything written here. The county pages and districts responsible for each service are listed once, under <a href="/community/#resources">resident resources</a>.</p>
