<h2 class="n-h3" id="acc-h" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:1.375rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">What we can confirm</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Second Avenue has continuous sidewalks with curb ramps at the cross streets, and the Whistle Stop Park lawn is reached from a paved path. Entrances vary across the historic block: several have a single step at the door and some have raised wooden porches.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Step-free access differs building by building, so contact a business directly before relying on it. Public restrooms and designated accessible parking have not yet been confirmed on the ground and are not claimed here. <a href="/contact/">Corrections and additions</a> to this section are welcome and published with their date.</p>
